# AlB2-type basis: M at position 0, B at positions 1 and 2.
# Species ordering: 0=Hf, 1=Zr, 2=Ti, 3=Ta, 4=Nb, 5=B.
# Boron sublattice is the spectator (compositionally fixed).
SPECTATOR_BASIS_SPECIES 1 5
SPECTATOR_BASIS_SPECIES 2 5

# Illustrative CSRO targets for refractory HEBs, large enough that the
# discrete pair counts at this supercell size (10 atoms per species,
# z=6 at the in-plane M-M shell) are unambiguously shifted away from
# the SQS solution. Pattern: Hf-Zr clustering, Hf-Cr ordering, Ti-Ta
# ordering, Ta-Nb clustering. Not validated against any DFT/MC study;
# they exercise the per-pair targeting machinery on the M sublattice.
# Shell 8 is the first M-M shell in this lattice (see heb_5metal_random
# for shell-index calibration).
SRO 0 1 8  0.30
SRO 0 2 8 -0.30
SRO 2 3 8 -0.30
SRO 3 4 8  0.30
